---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。"><section class="not-found wrap"><span class="eyebrow">404 / PAGE NOT FOUND</span><h1>这页还没有写好。</h1><p>地址可能已变更，也可能输入有误。回首页继续看看吧。</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="/">返回首页 ↗</a></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.not-found{padding-top:130px;padding-bottom:160px;min-height:65vh}.not-found h1{font-size:clamp(43px,6vw,72px);color:#173e36;letter-spacing:-.06em}.not-found p{color:#718176;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:28px}</style>
